WEBVTT

00:12:53.810 --> 00:13:00.775
(Applause)

00:13:02.854 --> 00:13:06.941
Our growing dependence on technology

00:13:06.965 --> 00:13:10.738
risks us becoming less skilled,

00:13:10.762 --> 00:13:12.357
more vulnerable

00:13:12.381 --> 00:13:15.332
to the deep and growing complexity

00:13:15.356 --> 00:13:16.729
of the real world.

00:13:17.951 --> 00:13:23.335
Now, as I was thinking about
the extremes of stress and turbulence

00:13:23.359 --> 00:13:26.015
that we know we will have to confront,

00:13:27.412 --> 00:13:30.364
I went and I talked to
a number of chief executives